        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been buying Dumet Olives from Healthy Planet for a while now, and they’ve become a staple in my kitchen. The quality is consistently excellent — firm texture, rich flavor, and just the right level of saltiness. Whether I'm adding them to salads, charcuterie boards, or just snacking straight from the jar, they never disappoint.\n\nWhat I especially appreciate is that they taste fresh and natural, without that overly processed brine flavor you sometimes get with store-bought olives. You can tell Dumet prioritizes quality ingredients and careful preparation.\n\nHealthy Planet always keeps them well-stocked, and I love that I can rely on them to carry such a great product. If you're an olive lover or just looking to elevate your meals with something simple and delicious, I highly recommend giving Dumet Olives a try.",
